      "rationale": "The uint32_t loop admits shifts 0, 7, 14, 21 and 28 only; the fifth-byte payload guard rejects values above 15 and a continuation then increments to 35 and exits. The reported 34-bit path is infeasible. Keep the bounded guard; do not alter wire parsing to satisfy the diagnostic."
